{"id":14748,"author":"hpux","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e1. What is your username in minecraft and what is your favorite game on Avicus?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eHello! ^-^ My in game name is GalaxyBrit but feel free to call me Britney, Brit, or Bri! Preferably not Britney Spears though (thanks). My favorite gamemode on Avicus Nebula.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e2. What are you most excited/obsessed over at the moment?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eRight now i'm really obsessed with music/singing. I like to listen to TheSoundYouNeed on youtube for some chill music. But I also enjoy listening to some remixes of popular songs. (ex: Jealous - The Rooftop Boys Remix) And i'm into singing atm because it's just fun c:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e3. Where are you from?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI'm from California, USA. {west coast represent}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e4. Are you in school, or do you have a job?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eYes I am in school as an upcoming Freshman in High School. No I do not have a job. Unless babysitting once in a while counts then yep.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e5. Who or what inspires you the most in your life?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI don't have one person specifically who inspires me. All I do is aspire to be a happy person in life.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e6. How do you contribute to the Avicus as a staff member?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eI moderate the best to my ability! I catch hackers, issue out punishments, help out players, mentor the jr. mods also known as my babies, and try my best to be active on the server, Slack, and Teamspeak. c:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e7. What are the most common questions you get asked while moderating or managing?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\"Why did you ban my friend!?,\" or \"Are you a gril?\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e8. Anything else you want to mention?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003eNot really but feel free to say hi to me if you see me in game. Have a nice day/night! :)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-user-select: none; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(61, 60, 64); font-family: 'Emoji Passthrough', Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; vertical-align: baseline; height: 0px; text-indent: -9999px; font-size: 0px; float: left; text-rendering: auto; -webkit-u